{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Balls is a First/Third-Person Multiplayer game where you and your friends can compete in a variety of Minigames, winner takes all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Balls recreates the feeling of rolling like a ball,  you can gain speed on slopes and hit jumps, and half pipes, use your momentum to gain even more speed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement Abilities - these let you gain even more speed, Drift,\u00a0 gravity slam, or charge up a boost to launch forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP - Damage players and launch them by hitting them at high speeds, the faster you go the more damage you deal, and the further you launch them. Everything dynamically scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to ??? players (4+ players is recommended)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Game-modes (so far, more to come)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Maps (Many more planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Speed Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoadMap - Races, character customization, more maps, more Game-modes.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828430?t=1761830907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828430?t=1761830907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/d67b2bd30d63725dae33a6499f403af932bd75b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761830907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/d67b2bd30d63725dae33a6499f403af932bd75b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17618